Fixes:
- Count time on a clock of 30 frames a second, the rate it was made for, so a 60 fps project plays it at the same speed.
- The wrapped clip sat in a box sized to its content, and a clip fills its parent, so it had no room: text wrapped to one letter per line; the box now has the frame's size, so the clip flies in whole and lands covering the frame.

